Ask Meson only for Boost modules that exist on WASI.

Meson resolves every listed module to a library file. Boost.Context and
Boost.URL are compiled for WASIX (see pkgs/overlay/packages/boost); Coroutine2
and Container are header-only here, and the WASI file-system path avoids
Boost.Iostreams.

--- a/src/libstore/meson.build
+++ b/src/libstore/meson.build
@@ -108,7 +108,7 @@

 boost = dependency(
   'boost',
-  modules : [
+  modules : host_machine.system() in ['wasi', 'wasip1'] ? ['url'] : [
     'container',
     # Shouldn't list, because can header-only, and Meson currently looks for libs
     #'regex',
